{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Forty days.</b> Corresponding to idolatry, for one who acknowledges idolatry denies the entire Torah, which was given over forty days. And corresponding to harlotry, for they imposed upon their Maker the task of forming the form of mamzers over forty days. And corresponding to robbery, for the number of robbery is forty."], :book :genesis, :voice :kli-yakar, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:27:33.167417333Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}